{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "JOB #1 arm j1s4 \u2014 n=20 powered A/B",
    "description": "JOB #1 A/B ARM (j1s4). EVOLVED seed 4 \u2014 closest to the hand point (L2 0.699) and kept coupling high (1.66). Gains baked into motor_epm; the evolver is present but at mutation_sigma 0 (SILENT OBSERVER) so it scores and instruments without publishing \u2014 every arm is therefore byte-identical apart from the eight gains. Protocol: arena, n=20, 12000 ticks, CHASSIS_COLLIDE=1 (height_homeo is one of the evolved gains, so a ghost belly would hide what it costs), outer-wall recentering OFF (irrelevant at 12k ticks and it would void net_disp/straight). \u26a0 NOT comparable to the recorded 3/20 tail, which was measured on a ghost chassis \u2014 that is why the hand point is re-run here as a fresh control rather than cited. gym_mode set to ARENA: metadata.gym_mode OUTRANKS the env var when launched from the UI, so a corridor default here would silently give you the wrong world.",
    "env_target": "picrawler",
    "gym_mode": "arena",
    "phase_tag": "motor-epm (minimal/deploy)",
    "derived_from_manifest": false,
    "episode_length": 6000,
    "mc_episode_period": 1500,
    "stability_gain": 0.05,
    "stability_y_norm": 0.5,
    "stability_speed": 0.05,
    "reward_shape": "trapezoid",
    "target_height": 0.085,
    "height_penalty_grace": 0.02,
    "height_penalty_scale": 0.03,
    "height_penalty_gain": 0.05,
    "leg_symmetry": "lr_pairs",
    "label": "motor_epm_rung0",
    "publish_tilt": false,
    "tier": "markov_compliant",
    "reward_class": "internal_objective",
    "scaffolds_active": [
      "postural",
      "coupling",
      "stroke",
      "amp_homeostat",
      "height_homeostat",
      "panic"
    ],
    "note": "step-size sweep v2, arm 'fix045' seed 1.  Start displaced: coupling 0.30 inside its BAD band.  v1 was invalidated by OGMA_SEED pinning every replicate to the same RNG, so its n=3 was n=1; replicates now vary OGMA_SEED.  sigma0 is the control v1 lacked \u2014 J fell in most arms, and without a no-search arm that is indistinguishable from the body settling."
  },
